Well, my worry is about the construction, not just the particular case, sin=
ce it does not seem to be resolvable in a logical way: "resembles something=
", "to some extent", "on some scale" -- maybe there are senses of "so" that=
 these work for, but none of them seem to be what is intended here.  {ju} a=
ctually seems closer to the point.
While a heap of puppies are often cuter than a single one, I doubt that the=
 mass of dogs is cute at all, even if cuteness is a frequent characteristic=
 of dogs.

